OL,3,GNEWSALorry trapped on level crossing
OL,4,Acauses rail delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain passengers faced delays and
OL,7,Fcancellations after a lorry became
OL,8,Fstuck on a level crossing in Nantwich.
OL,10,FThe lorry driver ignored the yellow box
OL,11,Fwarning on London Road and stopped
OL,12,Fwithin the markings, police said.
OL,14,FIt then became trapped when the
OL,15,Fbarriers were lowered causing the
OL,16,Frailway line to be temporarily blocked
OL,17,Fon Friday afternoon.
OL,19,FThe disruption, which has since been
OL,20,Fresolved, impacted Transport for Wales
OL,21,Fservices between Crewe and Shrewsbury,
OL,22,Fwith delays expected until the evening.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
